    "text": "By Staff Report, posted ,\n14 hours ago Fayetteville State University has named Christy Swinson, DNP, as the new associate dean of the School of Nursing, effective immediately. Swinson has served in the role on an interim basis since December 2025. In her new permanent capacity, she provides academic and administrative oversight for the university’s undergraduate and graduate nursing programs. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
